      "content": "but that thread feels like a trap. like i'm just being forced to keep dragging this heavy, broken version of myself through a life that doesn't even want me. what if the thing that's \"broken\" is just me? what if there isn't a way to make it okay? it feels like some things are just meant to end because they shouldn't have happened in the first place.",
